<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0391_R36R0101_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">This the Ruins of Alph. Ancient\nrocks, stacked up.\rWho would make somethin’ like this?\nAnd WHY? Ain’t they have TV?</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0391_R36R0101_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You seen that weird tree in the\nroad?\rThat’s why nobody visitin’ the\nRuins. That and the ruins is borin’.</language>
	</row>
</body>
